      en: "Luahan Agropark is an agricultural theme park in Brunei, opened in 2012. Located in the Tutong District, it covers 30 hectares. The park showcases sustainable farming methods such as hydroponics and aquaponics. Visitors can sample tropical fruits and join workshops. It features a petting zoo and picnic area. Operated by the Ministry of Agriculture, it serves educational and recreational purposes. Admission is free.",
